14.214 emacsvox-speedbar
========================

This module advises speedbar.el for use with Emacs.  The latest speedbar
can be obtained from ftp://ftp.ultranet.com/pub/zappo/ This module
ensures that speedbar works smoothly outside a windowing system in
addition to speech enabling all interactive commands.  Emacsvox also
adds an Emacsvox environment specific entry point to speedbar
-emacsvox-speedbar-goto-speedbar- and binds this

14.214.1 Emacsvox-Speedbar Commands
-----------------------------------

14.214.1.1 emacsvox-speedbar-click
..................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-speedbar-click

     Does the equivalent of the mouse click from the keyboard

14.214.1.2 emacsvox-speedbar-goto-speedbar
..........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-speedbar-goto-speedbar

     Switch to the speedbar


