14.221.1.4 emacsvox-table-find-csv-file
.......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-find-csv-file (filename)
     ‘C-e C-t ,’

     Process a csv (comma separated values) file.
     The processed  data is presented using emacsvox table navigation.

