14.221.1.22 emacsvox-table-sort-on-current-column
.................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-sort-on-current-column
     ‘C-e C-t #’

     Sort table on current column.

14.221.1.23 emacsvox-table-speak-both-headers-and-element
.........................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-speak-both-headers-and-element
     ‘C-e C-t b’

     Speak  both row and column header and table element

14.221.1.24 emacsvox-table-speak-column-filtered
................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-speak-column-filtered (&optional prefix)
