File: emacsvox.info,  Node: URL Templates,  Prev: xbacklight,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

14.274 URL Templates
====================

This section documents a total of 66 URL Templates.

   All of these URL templates can be invoked via command ‘M-x
emacsvox-url-template-fetch’ normally bound to ‘C-e u’.  This command
prompts for the name of the template, and completion is available via
Emacs' minibuffer completion.  Each URL template carries out the
following steps:
   • Prompt for the relevant information.
   • Fetch the resulting URL using an appropriate fetcher.
   • Set up the resulting resource with appropriate customizations.

  1. acu weather

     Weather Forecast from ACUWeather
  2. air traffic control

     Find live streams for Air Traffic Control.
  3. airport conditions

     Display airport conditions from the FAA.
  4. amazon product details by asin

     Retrieve product details from Amazon by either ISBN or ASIN.
  5. aqi from wunderground

     Air quality from Wunderground
  6. archwiki search

     Search Linux ArchWiki
  7. bbc 5-live schedule

     BBC Radio 5 Live Schedule
  8. bbc podcast directory

     BBC PodCast Directory
  9. bbc r4 extra schedule

     BBC Radio 4 Extra Schedule
  10. bbc r4 schedule

     BBC R4 Schedule
  11. bbc sounds

     Search BBC Sounds.  Result page is filtered down to two sections,
     Shows and Episodes.

     Press [RET] on links in the Show section to open that show page.
     The page for that show contains playable links for Episodes.

     Press 'y' on Episode links to play them with MPV.
  12. bbc world service schedule

     BBC World Service Schedule
  13. bing news

     Bing News results as RSS feed.
  14. business headlines from cnn

     Money Headlines From CNN
  15. cbs radio streams from streamtheworld

     Play radio stream.  Example: kcbsFM. Format is stationid+AM/FM.
  16. cnbc quotes

     Stock portfolio via CNBC
  17. cnbc ticker

     Stock Quote via CNBC
  18. cnn headlines

     News Headlines From CNN
  19. cnn money

     CNN Money
  20. cricinfo print

     Printer friendly link on Cricinfo
  21. dictionary lookup

     Dictionary Lookup
  22. emacsvox search via google

     Search Emacsvox Site
  23. espn cricinfo search

     Cricinfo Search Using Google
  24. finance google

     Lookup ticker on Google Finance.
  25. finance summary from google

     Display top stocks from Google Finance.
  26. freesound

     Search FreeSound.
  27. gita

     Open specific chapter/verse in the Gita
  28. global weather from google

     World Weather From Google
  29. google news search

     Search Google news.
  30. google scholar

     Google Scholar Search
  31. google trends

     Google Trends
  32. guardian rss feeds directory

     Guardian Feeds Directory
  33. hacker news frontpage

     Display Hacker News Front Page
  34. hacker news search

     Display Hacker News Front Page
  35. hoogle haskell api search

     Haskell API Search against a local server.
  36. html google news search

     Search Google news.
  37. local weather from google

     Light-weight Google weather.  Displays weather for your current
     US-ZIP Code.
  38. microsoft search

     Bing results as RSS feed.
  39. nba standings

     Display NBA standings.
  40. nls bard bookshelf

     NLS Bard Catalog: Most Popular.  Login once before using this
